    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf4c The fruit are falling again... and they\u2019re not alone.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Congratulations. You survived the fruitpocalypse. But now they\u2019re back. And this time\u2026 they brought friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fruit Hoop 2</strong> is the mind-meltingly ridiculous sequel to the indie classic <i>Fruit Hoop</i>. You once again take control of a hoop\u2014yes, just a hoop\u2014on an eternal mission to catch falling produce and dodge anything that wants you dead. But now, there are more fruits. More hazards. More bananas. So many bananas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf4a <strong>How to Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move your hoop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catch the good stuff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid the bad stuff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Repeat until your hands hurt or your brain melts.<br>(Or both.)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uded0 <strong>Still Not Convinced?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s like <i>Frogger</i> had a baby with a blender.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimal narrative, maximum vibes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed for that \u201cone more try\u201d loop that ruins sleep schedules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No microtransactions. Only macrofruit.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf4c The fruit are falling again... and they\u2019re not alone.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Congratulations. You survived the fruitpocalypse. But now they\u2019re back. And this time\u2026 they brought friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fruit Hoop 2</strong> is the mind-meltingly ridiculous sequel to the indie classic <i>Fruit Hoop</i>. You once again take control of a hoop\u2014yes, just a hoop\u2014on an eternal mission to catch falling produce and dodge anything that wants you dead. But now, there are more fruits. More hazards. More bananas. So many bananas.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf4a <strong>How to Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move your hoop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Catch the good stuff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid the bad stuff.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Repeat until your hands hurt or your brain melts.<br>(Or both.)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\uded0 <strong>Still Not Convinced?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s like <i>Frogger</i> had a baby with a blender.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimal narrative, maximum vibes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed for that \u201cone more try\u201d loop that ruins sleep schedules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No microtransactions. Only macrofruit.</p></li></ul>",
